#: main0106.xhp#par_id3150440.2.help.text
#: main0106.xhp%23par_id3150440.2.help.text
msgid ""
"<ahelp hid=\".\">The <emph>Tools </emph>menu contains commands to check "
"spelling, to trace sheet references, to find mistakes and to define "
"scenarios.</ahelp>"
msgstr ""
"<ahelp hid=\".\">የ <emph>መሳሪያዎች </emph>ዝርዝር የያዘው ትእዛዝ ፊደል ለ ማረም: የ ወረቀት "
"ማመሳከሪያ ፈልጎ ለ ማግኘት: ስህተት ፈልጎ ለ ማግኘት: እና ትእይንቶችን ለ መግለጽ ይጠቅማል:</ahelp>"

#: main0106.xhp#par_id3152576.10.help.text
#: main0106.xhp%23par_id3152576.10.help.text
msgid ""
"You can also create and assign macros and configure the look and feel of "
"toolbars, menus, keyboard, and set the default options for $[officename] "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"እርስዎ ማክሮ መፍጠር እና መመደብ ይችላሉ እና በ እቃ መደርደሪያ ላይ ምን እንደሚመስል: ዝርዝር: የ ፊደል ገበታ: እና "
"ነባር ምርጫ ማሰናዳት ይችላሉ: ለ $[officename] መተግበሪያዎች:"

